<title>UK: Estates &amp; General makes &quot;progress&quot; in Q1.</title>
<headline>Estates &amp; General makes &quot;progress&quot; in Q1.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>British property company Estates &amp; General Plc said on Wednesday that it made further &quot;substantial progress&quot; in improving profitability and strength in the first three months of this year.  </p>
<p>&quot;During the first quarter, the company has made significant progress in letting vacant property,&quot; Estates &amp; General told shareholders at its annual general meeting.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
